{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2836","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2836","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2836\",\"parent_revision\":\"c4fc7056473491e0ecde3a11d938c440be58bdab\",\"root_revision\":\"137169457a6e88423ae52750677bcba42d8adcfaaa3b0c0bc57ce1a6b3c7ee09\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Suggested Approach\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nBatch via `research-curator` agent/skill re-runs per entry (or per category directory) to backfill the missing sections from the original source material \u2014 not a mechanical section-header insert, since the sections need real content (Overview, architecture, etc.), not placeholders.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Problem\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n`validate-research-entries` (`.claude/skills/research-curator/scripts/validate_research.py`) reports 69 of 339 research entries under `research/` missing one or more required body sections (`Overview`, `Problem Addressed`, `Key Features`, `Technical Architecture`, `Installation & Usage`, `Relevance to Claude Code Development`, `References`). These are genuine content gaps \u2014 entries written before the current research-curator template was adopted \u2014 not a regression from any single change.\\n\\nThis check now runs as its own advisory CI job (`Research / Entry validation`, added in the CI-fix branch alongside this issue) so it's visible on every PR without blocking the Quality Gate. It should be wired in as a blocking gate once this backlog is cleared.\\n\\nNote: the 4 header metadata fields (`research_date`, `source_url`, `version_at_research`, `license`) were downgraded from error to warning in this same change \u2014 missing metadata alone no longer fails validation, only missing body content does. So this issue is scoped to real content gaps, not administrative metadata.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Success Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n```bash\\nuv run .claude/skills/research-curator/scripts/validate_research.py research/\\n```\\n\\nexits 0 with 339/339 passed, then `research-validation` can be added to `quality-gate`'s `needs` in `.github/workflows/code-quality.yml`.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Reproduce\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n```bash\\nuv run .claude/skills/research-curator/scripts/validate_research.py research/ --verbose\\n```\\n\\nExpected: 69 entries reported `\u2717` with one or more `Missing section: ...` errors.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Scope As Of 2026 08 10\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z-0</sub>\\n\\n69 files across the `research/` tree, ranging from a single missing section (e.g. `agent-frameworks/browser-harness-js.md` \u2014 missing only `Overview`) to entries missing all 7 required sections (e.g. `agent-frameworks/AutoResearchClaw.md`). Re-run the reproduction command for the current, authoritative list and per-file detail \u2014 do not treat this issue body as the list of record.\\n</div>\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z-1</sub>\\n\\n69 files across the `research/` tree, ranging from a single missing section (e.g. `agent-frameworks/browser-harness-js.md` \u2014 missing only `Overview`) to entries missing all 7 required sections (e.g. `agent-frameworks/AutoResearchClaw.md`). Re-run the reproduction command for the current, authoritative list and per-file detail \u2014 do not treat this issue body as the list of record.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"4ffc90431e96a6e915206de82294c57ab679e1f611b956d800e6620614e33c99\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABSd-LEA\"}"}